cept wendy shoots a  hurricane-like blast straight at her  target where wendy's differs is that she  can combine skydragon's raw with cure  combining her attack and healing powers  she used this to cure the memory block  placed on eregor rendering him unable to  continue in the battle the final  permanent member of team natsu is carla  carla is wendy's companion and an exceed  just like happy except carla is the  daughter of queen chigotay the current  ruler of the exceeds as an exceed she  has the same error ability as happy in  which she can sprout wings giving her  the ability of flight that speeds are  all determined by her magic power what i  mean by that is the same as happy so the  more magic power that is used the faster  she will be able to fly the faster she  flies the quicker it will drain her  magic power you get this right you get  this now carla can also use transform  magic but is much better at this than  happy after just one year of training  carla can transform into a human girl  that matches wendy's age in this form  she does keep her tail and cat ears but  the key difference is that carla's magic  is increased by a bit meaning her  precognition ability also gains a boost  precognition you say let me explain as  the daughter of the queen of exceeds  carla inherited her mother's ability to  predict where and when something will  happen it's important to note here that  carla and her mother are the only  exceeds within the entire race to have  this ability okay on to the temporary  members of team natsu starting with  elfman stross elfman's magic is takeover  takeover is an advanced caster type  magic that allows the user to take over  the power abilities and appearance of  other beings and use them for their own  this often gives the caster a boost in  strength power and speed but the user  can also gain a new skill such as flight  or breathing underwater as an example  the downside to this ability is that  they can only take over the things that  