ive nature to claim to be  michelle lobster a distant relative and  the half-sister of lucy heartfelia  imitation actually turns out not to be  michelle lobster but an animated form of  a doll lucy used to play with during her  childhood so in terms of powers she has  the obvious transformation magic  transformation magic is again a caster  type magic where the user is able to  completely change their appearance basic  forms of this magic is relatively easy  for pretty much any mage to use but  higher level mages such as imitation and  mirror jane had to get under the best  girl in there of course again  culture they can perform this magic and  all of its levels with great ease  transformation isn't the only magic she  can use but plant magic too another  caster type magic plant magic gives the  caster the power to create and  manipulate plants imitate can use plant  magic in combat as a form of attack  where she can produce many thorned vines  that will wrap around her targets and  target their vital points she can also  use plant magic for defense as she can  create a flower shield to block incoming  attacks to finish off her powers and  abilities it is worth touching on the  pros of her being a doll now because  imitation is a doll she has an immunity  to pain due to her doll-like nature she  boasts that it is impossible for her to  lose in combat to add to her claim even  further she is almost indestructible due  to the fact that she can mend broken  bones and muscles even neck injuries  won't finish her off imitation might be  a doll but she doesn't play around  10 out of 10 dad joke right final  temporary member of team natsu is messed  grider mest was a former member of the  magic council and is now a member of the  fairy tale guild his power is that of  memory control a caster type magic that  allows mess to add his existence to  another person's memory where he can  manipulate them delete memories and even  completely rewrite them as you can  imagine this m